**STAT 514 • ITMD 514 • ITMS 514**

Welcome to the course website!

This website serves as the primary repository for course materials throughout the semester. Here you will find lecture notes, homework assignments, datasets, and additional resources.

---

## Course Materials

### 📖 Lecture Notes

Lecture notes are organized by topic and updated throughout the semester.

Topics include:

- Introduction to R and RStudio
- Introduction to Statistics
- Random Variables
- Probability Distributions
- Exploratory Data Analysis
- Statistical Inference
- Regression
- Classification

---

### 💻 Homework

Homework assignments are posted here as R Markdown files.

Each homework page includes

- Assignment description
- Required files
- Download links
- Submission instructions

**Please submit completed assignments through Canvas.**

---

### 📂 Data Sets

Datasets used in lectures and homework will be available for download.

