## Course Workflow

Throughout the semester, students are expected to

1. Read the lecture notes.
2. Download the homework files.
3. Complete assignments using R Markdown.
4. Knit the completed document to HTML.
5. Submit the required files through Canvas.

---

We hope this website provides a convenient and organized resource throughout the course.
